The behavioural SPICE subcircuits in this folder (lm27762_beh.lib, ref3030_beh.lib, tmux_beh.lib,
dac8551_beh.lib, mcp3564_beh.lib) are original works of this project, fitted to datasheet figures that
are quoted, with their datasheet section, in the comment block of each file. They contain no vendor
model text.

Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC-BY-SA 4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

Vendor SPICE models (TI OPA354/OPA365 etc.) are NOT in this folder and are never copied: netlists
reference them by relative path from hardware/afe-proto/models/ , where they stay local.
